%description:
Tests a probe of the path MTU search (mtuProbing = 2) that another
retransmission ends without a result. The scenario is that of tcp_mtu_probe_1,
but the tester deletes B020, the segment before the probe B021 (MTU 1026). The
probe arrives, and the third duplicate ACK starts a fast retransmit of B020
(B038). As Linux __tcp_retransmit_skb() ("Inconclusive MTU probe"), this
retransmission ends the probe: the ACK of the probe later raises no MSS, and the
bounds of the search stay. Only a probe that is the first unacknowledged segment
where a loss recovery starts is lost (tcp_mtu_probe_2).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 600
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 2
*.srv_tcp.baseMss = 512
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500
*.tcptester.script="b20 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.017 B020] A.1000 < B.2000: A 11301:11901(600) ack 1 win 16384 # deleting
[1.017 B021] A.1000 < B.2000: A 11901:12887(986) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.021 B038] A.1000 < B.2000: A 11301:11901(600) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: sent an MTU probe of 986 bytes (MTU 1026)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: a retransmission ends the MTU probe of 1026 without a result
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is acknowledged
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is lost
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
